In:

Shift: 33
Capture Button: 42
Capture CV: 32
Strike: 38
Strike CV: 36
Switch XY: 23
Switch AB: 26

Out:
Trigger: 34
+ W: 40
+ Y: 41
Fwd W: 37
Fwd Y: 22
Rev W: 35
