Button Combinations

Double Shift: Track and Snap

Capture: Record
Strike: Trigger Grain

Shift+Capture:
Layer: OnsetMode
Scan: Toggle FollowMode
Hold: Output Phase Switch
Dub: Switch Capture behaviour from
Strike: save/load to SD t<2000
Strike: export/import to USB t>2000

Shift+Strike: undo/delete/load
